title: Onboarding_GameScene_1
---
<<SetCharacterPicture>>
ScoreBar: Your goal is to score points and reach the target score of the room.
DepositBox: You earn points by putting carefully selected items in the <b>deposit box</b>.
DepositBoxNumber: Each item is worth a specific amount of points. You can only choose <b>4</b> items.
Lever: Once you have picked good items, you can pull on the lever to confirm your choice.
Timer: Here you can see how many <b>seconds</b> you have left before the end of the <b>timer</b>.
Timer: Pull the lever and score items as many time as you can before it reaches 0 !
PlayButton: You can start whenever you want during your first round by pressing the <b>"play"</b> button.
Pause: Also, by pressing <sprite name=Input_Space> you can <b>pause</b> the game if you need to take a break !
===
title: Onboarding_GameScene_2
---
<<SetCharacterPicture>>
Center: Some items will be worth more when put together.
Center: For example, you can try to make a <b>combination</b>.
Center: If you pick 4 or more items from the same family, each item will be worth +5.
Center: There are many <b>combinations</b> that you can discover, try to match items together! 
Pause: You can see all the combinations discovered in the pause menu.

===
title: Onboarding_GameScene_3
---
<<SetCharacterPicture>>
Discard: Sometimes you can't find anything interesting or the <b>crate</b> is empty.
Discard: When that happens, you can click on this <b>little guy</b> to get a new full crate !
Timer: Careful though, you will loose a few seconds while the <b>crate</b> is being replaced.
===
title: Onboarding_Powers
---
<<SetCharacterPicture>>
Powers: Your powers charge with time.  
Powers: Once they're ready, click on their buttons to use them !
Powers: Here, this one will give you more time!
===
title: Onboarding_GameScene_CountScore1
---
<<SetCharacterPicture>>
PlayButton: You can press down the left button of your mouse to go faster during the score count.
===
